# Evolith CLI Commands Matrix

> **Document Type:** Corporate Standard
> **Status:** Active
> **Date:** 2026-06-06
> **Purpose:** Define which CLI commands Evolith CLI can execute vs which require external tools.

---

## 1. Command Support Categories

| Category | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| **Native** | Evolith implements and executes directly |
| **Scaffold** | Evolith generates config files only, requires external CLI |
| **Delegated** | External tool must be installed; Evolith only orchestrates |
| **Unsupported** | Not implemented; requires manual execution |

---

## 2. Runtime Commands

### Node.js / TypeScript (Native)

| Tool | Command | Support | Notes |
|------|---------|---------|-------|
| npm | `npm init` | ✅ Native | Project initialization |
| npm | `npm install` | ✅ Native | Install dependencies |
| npm | `npm run <script>` | ✅ Native | Execute scripts |
| npx | `npx tsc` | ✅ Native | TypeScript compilation |
| npx | `npx eslint` | ✅ Native | Linting |
| npx | `npx jest` | ✅ Native | Test execution |
| pnpm | `pnpm install` | ⚠️ Scaffold | Generates pnpm-workspace.yaml |
| yarn | `yarn install` | ⚠️ Scaffold | Generates yarn.lock |

### .NET / C# (Native)

| Tool | Command | Support | Notes |
|------|---------|---------|-------|
| dotnet CLI | `dotnet new` | ✅ Native | Project templates |
| dotnet CLI | `dotnet build` | ✅ Native | Compilation |
| dotnet CLI | `dotnet test` | ✅ Native | Test execution |
| dotnet CLI | `dotnet run` | ✅ Native | Run application |
| dotnet CLI | `dotnet add package` | ✅ Native | Add NuGet package |
| dotnet CLI | `dotnet ef` | ⚠️ Scaffold | Requires EF Core tools |

### Python (Native)

| Tool | Command | Support | Notes |
|------|---------|---------|-------|
| pip | `pip install` | ✅ Native | Install packages |
| poetry | `poetry install` | ⚠️ Scaffold | Generates pyproject.toml |
